WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:07.098
To convert a file, click Choose files, or simply drag it onto the page.

2
00:00:07.498 --> 00:00:12.384
A ring of formats appears. Pick the one you want, for example a JPEG.

3
00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:17.574
Your file is converted straight away, on your own device. Click Save.

4
00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:20.748
That's it. Nothing was uploaded.
